{
  "_comment": "First-party Farmer's Delight WILD-CROP compat on the FOREST family (FARMERSDELIGHTPLAN #16). A Forest seed over a farmable biome rolls a lightly-treed 'wild clearing' variant scattered with FD wild crops — the on-island BOOTSTRAP for FD (its wild-crop worldgen never fires in the void). Selectors are BYTE-IDENTICAL to the base forest bands so they MERGE (append a variant) instead of shadowing (ThemeOverride.mergeBands). COVERAGE: bands cover the catch-all #is_forest PLUS the specific forest sub-biomes that match before it (birch / flower / dark / taiga / jungle) so a forest island over any of them still grows crops (v0.2 fix — the first pass only covered 5 bands, leaving birch/dark/taiga/jungle throws barren). WEIGHTS are ~50% (crop variant weight ≈ the sum of the base band's variants) so crops are reliably findable, not a rare roll; the variant keeps the biome's tree so the island still reads foresty. Every farmersdelight: id resolves via Lookup.hasBlock — unknown → skipped, so generation is byte-identical WITHOUT Farmer's Delight. IDS VERIFIED vs FarmersDelight-1.21.1-1.3.2.jar. Shared verbatim across forest/forest_large/huge_forest (mirror rule); only target differs.",
  "target": "skyseed:forest",
  "biome_overrides": [
    { "_comment": "temperate forest floor (catch-all) — onions/potatoes/carrots; weight 5 vs base oak3+birch2 → ~50%",
      "biomes": ["#minecraft:is_forest"],
      "variants": [ { "weight": 5, "name": "wild_forest_crops", "decoration": {
        "trees": [ { "feature": "minecraft:oak", "tries": 4, "spacing": 3 } ],
        "ground": [ { "block": "minecraft:short_grass", "chance": 0.18 },
          { "block": "farmersdelight:wild_onions", "chance": 0.05 },
          { "block": "farmersdelight:wild_potatoes", "chance": 0.05 },
          { "block": "farmersdelight:wild_carrots", "chance": 0.05 } ] } } ] },
    { "_comment": "birch forest — onions/potatoes/carrots",
      "biomes": ["minecraft:birch_forest", "minecraft:old_growth_birch_forest"],
      "variants": [ { "weight": 1, "name": "wild_birch_crops", "decoration": {
        "trees": [ { "feature": "minecraft:birch", "tries": 4, "spacing": 3 } ],
        "ground": [ { "block": "minecraft:short_grass", "chance": 0.18 },
          { "block": "farmersdelight:wild_onions", "chance": 0.05 },
